    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho ng'omwaka gutoolera, mu biseera bakyabazinga ghe baajiiranga okulwana entalo, Daudi yaatuma Yoabu ng'ali n'abagheereza be ghalala n'Abaisiraeli boonaboona. Baaja baalumba Abammoni, baabaghangula era baazingiza ekibuga Rabba okukyezunguluza. Aye Daudi mwene yaasigala e Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.20.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Byom 20:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwali lulala eiguloigulo, Daudi yaasituka yaava ku buliri bwe ng'amaze okulambaala okuwuumulaku, yaatambulatambula ghaigulu ku ngulu okw'endhu ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "... Ku ngulu okw'endhu ...:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Obusulya obw'endhu tibwabangaku migongo. Kale ng'omuntu asobola okutambuliraku obukalamu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ng'ali eyo ghaigulu yaalengera omukazi ali kunaaba, ng'aboneka bulungi inho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Daudi yaatuma abakwenda babuulirize ebigema ku mukazi oyo. Baamukobera bati, ni Bathisheba mughala wa Eliamu era muka Uria Omuhitti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Daudi yaatuma abakwenda baamunona baamumutwalira, yaaba naye mu buliri. Omukazi oyo yali ali kwetukuza, nga yaakava mu kulwala okwa buli mwezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho omukazi oyo yaatoola enda, yaatuma baakobera Daudi bati ali mabunda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaagheereza Yoabu obukwenda ng'akoba ati: “Mpeereza Uria Omuhitti aidhe.” Yoabu yaagheereza Uria eri Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uria bwe yatuuka ye Daudi, Daudi yaamubuuza Yoabu n'abalwani bwe bali, n'olutalo bwe luli kuja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwamala, Daudi yaakoba Uria ati: “Ja ewuwo owuumuleku.” Uria yaafuluma mu ndhu ya kyabazinga yaaja. Agho ekirabo kyamuvaaku einhuma nga bakireeta okuva ye kyabazinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Uria yaaloba kuja ka, yaasula agho gha mulyango gw'endhu ya kyabazinga n'abagheereza ba musengwa we oyo abandi boonaboona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi baamukobera bati: “Uria tiyajiire wuwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho yaabuuza Uria ati: “Tiwaviire mu lugendo luleeyi? Memale lwaki tiwajiire wuwo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uria yaamwiramu ati: “Esanduuku y'Endagaano eri mu ntindi, n'abasaadha aba Isiraeli n'aba Yuda boonaboona basula mu ntindi. Era musengwa wange Yoabu n'abagheereza be, basimbye weema dhaibwe mu irungu. Memale nze nnaaja ntya eka, okulya, okunhwa n'okusula ni mukazi wange? Busa naire. Ndayira musengwa wange iwe kyabazinga omulamu nti, tiidha kukola kintu ng'oti n'ekyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Daudi yaakoba Uria ati: “Kale sigala ghano n'olwaleero. Enkyo ndidha kukusiibula oje” Uria yaasigala mu Yerusalemu olunaku olwo n'olwairirira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaamweta yaalya naye era yaanhwa naye, yaamutamiiza. Aye era Uria yaaloba kuja wuwe. Yaasula ghalala n'abagheereza ba musengwa we Daudi oyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe bwakya enkyo Daudi yaaghandiikira Yoabu embaluwa, yaagigha Uria agimutwalire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mbaluwa omwo yaghandiikamu ati: “Ta Uria emberi mu lutalo aghasinga kuba ghabi, memale imwe mumuleke eyo mwire einhuma, abazigu bamufumite bamwite.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Yoabu bwe yaazingiza ekibuga okukyezunguluza, yaata Uria mu kifo ghe yali aidhi nga n'aghali abasaadha abaziramu ntete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abasaadha ab'omu kibuga baidha baalwana ni Yoabu. Baita abandi ku bagheereza ba Daudi. Uria Omuhitti yeena baamwitiramu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yoabu yaagheereza Daudi amawulire goonagoona agagema ku lutalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaalagira omukwenda ye yatuma ati: “Bw'onaamala okukobera kyabazinga amawulire goonagoona agagema ku lutalo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kyabazinga n'asungughala era n'akubuuza ati, ‘Lwaki mwaseeta kumpi inho n'ekibuga nga mukirwanisa? Ti mwamanha nga baidha kubalasa nga bali ku kimante? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naani eyaita Abimeleki mutabane wa Yerubbeshethi? Omukazi tiyali ku kimante memale n'amusuulaku enso ey'olubengo, n'afiira e Thebezi? Lwaki mwaseeta kumpi inho n'ekimante mutyo?’ Oidha kumukoba oti, ‘N'omugheereza wo Uria Omuhitti yeena bamwise.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.9.53"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Balam 9:53",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale omukwenda yaaja ye Daudi, yaamukobera byonabyona Yoabu bye yamutuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamukobera ati: “Abazigu baasooka baatunhigiriza, baavaayo mu kibuga baidha okutulwanisa mu nsiko. Aye twamala twababingirira twabaizaayo ku mulyango ogw'ekibuga ekyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho ab'obulaso baatoolera okutulasa nga bali ku kimante, baita abandi ku bagheereza bo, Isebantu kyabazinga. N'omugheereza wo Uria Omuhitti yeena bamwise.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
