              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaakoba omukwenda ati: “Ja okobe Yoabu oti, ‘Ebyo ebibairegho bitakumalamu maani, kuba ghazira aghanga kumanha oyo anaafiira mu lutalo. Kale ni weeyongere bwa kulumba ekibuga ekyo n'amaani, okigeme.’ Era weena omwizeemu amaani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
