          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiseera eky'okulira bwe kyawaaku, Daudi yaatuma abakwenda baaleeta Bathisheba oyo mu kisaagaati kya kyabazinga, yaamufuula mukazi we, era yamuzaalira omwana omulenzi. Aye ekintu ekyo Daudi kye yakola kyasungughaza Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
